# Object permanence. A morsel is painted only while it is inside the field of view, so turning toward one target drops the others from the map and a corner hides the very morsel being chased, which makes the agent dither and abandon approaches. Seen, wanted morsels (appetite-weighted, minus refusals) are written into a slowly fading memory channel that keeps injecting after they leave view and is erased once the agent stands on or beside the spot; unlike the ghost law, smell waypoints and frontier marks are not remembered. Base is #9 (ballistic exploration + learned doors as curiosity), which was the first law to eat on world 16.

# Object permanence: a morsel is painted only while it is in the field of view,
# so turning toward one target drops the others and a corner hides the one being
# chased. Seen, wanted morsels are remembered on the map (fading slowly, erased
# under and beside the agent) and keep injecting after they leave view. Smell and
# frontier are NOT remembered (the ghost's mistake). Base: #9 (ballistic + doors).
channel source
channel solid
channel free
channel thing
channel scent
channel bad
channel here
channel value
channel confinement
channel trail
channel behind
channel door
channel seen
channel injection

rule calc_conf:
  when 1
  set confinement = sum8(solid)

rule remember_path:
  when 1
  set trail = max(here, 0.995 * trail)

rule spread_behind:
  when 1
  set behind = 0.99 * avg8(behind) + 0.01 * trail

rule find_doors:
  when 1
  set door = solid * clamp(2 * (leak - 0.5), 0, 1) * clamp(sum4(free), 0, 1)

# Where a wanted morsel was last seen; gone once the agent stands on or beside it.
rule remember_things:
  when 1
  set seen = max(thing * min(source, 1) * (1 - bad), 0.995 * seen) * (1 - here) * (1 - max8(here))

rule inject:
  when 1
  set injection = max(where(max(thing, scent) > 0, max(thing, source), source * exp(-40 * behind)) / (1 + 0.5 * confinement), 0.3 * door * exp(-40 * behind), seen / (1 + 0.5 * confinement))

rule wave:
  when 1
  set value = max(injection, max(0.94 * max4(value), 0.916214 * max8(value))) * (1 - solid * (1 - leak))
